You are tasked with implementing a method to process an array of pixel values. Each pixel value is represented by an integer in the range [0, 255]. The method should calculate the frequency of each pixel value in the array and return the most frequent pixel value. If there are multiple pixel values with the same highest frequency, return the smallest of those values.

You are given the following method signature to implement:

```java
