- The user may be subject to different tax rates based on their location.
- Shipping costs may vary based on the shipping address and the total cost of the order.

Your implementation should accurately calculate the total cost, including taxes and shipping, and create an `Order` object with the appropriate details.

```java
import com.rrcorpus.domain.Order;
import com.rrcorpus.domain.ShippingAddress;
import com.rrcorpus.domain.ShoppingCart;
import com.rrcorpus.domain.User;

public class OrderServiceImpl implements OrderService {
    private TaxCalculator taxCalculator;
    private ShippingCalculator shippingCalculator;

    public OrderServiceImpl(TaxCalculator taxCalculator, ShippingCalculator shippingCalculator) {
        this.taxCalculator = taxCalculator;
        this.shippingCalculator = shippingCalculator;
    }

    @Override
    public Order createOrder(ShoppingCart shoppingCart, User user, ShippingAddress shippingAddress) {
        double subtotal = calculateSubtotal(shoppingCart);
        double tax = taxCalculator.calculateTax(subtotal, user.getLocation());
        double shippingCost = shippingCalculator.calculateShippingCost(subtotal, shippingAddress);

        double totalCost = subtotal + tax + shippingCost;

        Order order = new Order();
        order.setItems(shoppingCart.getItems());
        order.setTotalCost(totalCost);
        order.setShippingAddress(shippingAddress);

        return order;
    }

    private double calculateSubtotal(ShoppingCart shoppingCart) {
        double subtotal = 0.0;
        for (CartItem item : shoppingCart.getItems()) {
            subtotal += item.getPrice() * item.getQuantity();
        }
        return subtotal;
    }
}
```

In the solution, we implement the `createOrder` method to calculate the subtotal, tax, shipping cost, and total cost. We use separate `TaxCalculator` and `ShippingCalculator` interfaces to calculate taxes and shipping costs based on the user's location and shipping address. The `Order` object is then created with the calculated total cost and shipping details.

